  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efate Earthquake TA, Recovery and Construction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa0;and engineering support to the Ministry of Infrastructure and Public Utilities to support decision making, building assessments and the opening up of the CBD;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA&#xa0;&lt;/strong&gt;to Port Vila City Council to provide advice on opening up the CBD, traffic management and coordinating and prioritizing the structural assessments;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to conduct detailed assessments of public buildings and critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction&#xa0;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;repairs&#xa0;&lt;/strong&gt;of urgent education and corrections infrastructure facilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
